  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '5 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      3
      <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES_1
    value: LINES
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_01
    value: WILD
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_01
    value: Appears on reels 2,3,4 and 5 and substitutes for all symbols except
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_02
    value: SCATTER
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_02
    value: 3 Scatters on reels 1, 2 and 3 triggers <style=coinColor>Oriental Luck
      Free Games</style>.
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_03
    value: RANDOM JACKPOT FEATURE
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_03
    value: 'In any spin, player can randomly trigger Wheel of Jackpots and win one
      of four jackpots: Mini, Minor, Major or Grand.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_04
    value: RE-SPIN FEATURE
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_04
    value: '- <indent=1em>4 or more Wild Symbols anywhere on reels 2,3,4 or 5 triggers
      Re-Spin Feature.</indent>

      - <indent=1em>All triggering Wild Symbols
      get locked until Re-Spin Feature ends.</indent>

      - <indent=1em>Reel 1
      is dimmed out but it keeps spinning until the Re-Spin Feature ends.</indent>

      -
      <indent=1em>Reels 2, 3, 4, and 5 do the Re-Spin(s).</indent>

      - <indent=1em>Each
      Re-Spin, if additional Wild symbol(s) lands on the rest of the spots where
      triggering Wild Symbols do not occupy, then one more Re-Spin is awarded and
      gets locked.</indent>

      - <indent=1em>Re-Spin Feature continues until
      there is no extra Wild Symbols.</indent>

      - <indent=1em>When additional
      Wild Symbols do not appear, Re-Spin Feature ends, reel 1 stops and line wins
      are paid.</indent>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_05
    value: MULTIPLIER WILD FEATURE
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_05
    value: '- <indent=4em>can appear on reel 5 only during any spin of Base Games
      (including Re-Spin Feature), not Free Games.</indent>

      - <indent=1em>Multiplier
      Wilds appear in stacks.</indent>

      - <indent=1em>It works as a Wild symbol
      with a random multiplier.</indent>

      - <indent=1em>Like regular Wild Symbols,
      Multiplier Wild Symbols get locked during Re-Spin Feature.</indent>

      -
      <indent=1em>Re-Spin or not, as long as in Base Games, the multipliers of such
      Wilds are calculated by multiplication and are applied to the line wins</indent>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_06
    value: ORIENTAL LUCK FREE GAMES
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_06
    value: '- <indent=1em>Scatter Symbols appear on reels 1, 2 and 3 only.</indent>

      -
      <indent=1em>3 Scatters on reels 1, 2 and 3 triggers 10 Free Games.</indent>

      -
      <indent=1em>During Free Games, Wild Symbols get locked until Free Games ends.</indent>

      -
      <indent=1em>No Multiplier Wild Symbols appear during Free Games.</indent>

      -
      <indent=1em>If another Wild Symbol lands on the same spot where a Wild is locked,
      then the spot with Wild increase the multiplier by 1.</indent>

      - <indent=1em>Re-trigger
      is possible and it awards 5 more Free Games.</indent>'
